l class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Go where no frog has dared to go before!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Methodical platforming</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Difficult but addictive gameplay</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There's only one place to go and that's up! What lies beyond the slippery ascent? Do you have what it takes to reach for the stars? What lies above? What is drawing you to the sky? Uncover the mystery! Become the frog you were always meant to be!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Retro-Style Pixel Art <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657470/extras/Screenshot_2025-04-21_042451.png?t=1745464221\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657470/extras/Screenshot_2025-04-23_064713.png?t=1745464221\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657470/extras/Screenshot_2025-04-23_065044.png?t=1745464221\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gorf<br>Made in Unity</p>","developers":["Mitchell Schreiter"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657470/98666c2c06005fc6ac9b596e55366db87cb4a420/header.jpg?t=1745464221","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257130009,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257130009/movie480.mp4?t=1745441704","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257130009/movie_max.mp4?t=1745441704"},"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257130009/a4f0052ff6486fd8033c8ca78d9ca6c35e720a86/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1745441704","webm":{"